  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunk_type": "isnad",
      "arabic_text": "مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ يَحْيَى عَنْ أَحْمَدَ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ عَنْ عَلِيِّ بْنِ حَدِيدٍ عَنْ مُرَازِمٍ عَنْ مُصَادِفٍ قَالَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Muhammad ibn Yahya, from Ahmad ibn Muhammad, from Ali ibn Hadeed, from Murazim, from Musadif who said:"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "كُنْتُ مَعَ أَبِي عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) فِي أَرْضٍ لَهُ وَ هُمْ يَصْرِمُونَ فَجَاءَ سَائِلٌ يَسْأَلُ فَقُلْتُ اللَّهُ يَرْزُقُكَ فَقَالَ ( عليه السلام ) مَهْ لَيْسَ ذَلِكَ لَكُمْ حَتَّى تُعْطُوا ثَلَاثَةً فَإِذَا أَعْطَيْتُمْ ثَلَاثَةً فَإِنْ أَعْطَيْتُمْ فَلَكُمْ وَ إِنْ أَمْسَكْتُمْ فَلَكُمْ .",
      "translations": {
        "en": "I was with Abu Abdullah (peace be upon him) in a land of his, and they were harvesting. So a beggar came asking for something, so I said, 'May Allah provide for you.' He (peace be upon him) said, 'Hush! That is not for you (to say) until you have given to three (beggars). So when you have given to three, then if you give, it is for you (to do so), and if you withhold, it is for you (to do so).'."
      }
    }
  ],
  "translations": {
    "en": {
      "summary": "This hadith outlines a specific legal ruling regarding the etiquette of giving charity (sadaqah) from one's own wealth while in the presence of an Imam. It establishes that one should not merely wish for God to provide for the beggar verbally until they have actually given to three beggars, after which they gain the discretion to either give or withhold further charity.",
      "seo_question": "What is the condition for a person to have the discretion to give or withhold charity according to Imam al-Sadiq?",
      "key_terms": {
        "يَصْرِمُونَ": "Harvesting/picking crops",
        "سَائِلٌ": "Beggar/asker",
        "اللَّهُ يَرْزُقُكَ": "May Allah provide for you (a common supplication for the beggar)",
        "مَهْ": "Hush/Be quiet (an interjection of silence)",
        "ثَلَاثَةً": "Three (referring to three beggars)"
      }
